  "invariants": [
    "Pinned service and fresh registrar purpose signature cannot substitute for independent owner-pinned QA signature; QA key must differ from registrar/identity/recipe root keys.",
    "QA qualification purpose is distinct from content-change approval receipts. Registrar claims and independently signed QA report must bind exact original job/requester/epoch/policy/revision/recipe/catalog/capture/profile/parity/source/template/helper values.",
    "Report SHA256 is canonical qa_report_claims digest. Closed signatures/schemas/hashes alone do not qualify: independently retrieve/verify bounded artifacts and trusted run metadata before retention.",
    "Verify actual completed run, attempt, protected ref, exact reviewed runner/workflow/engine/config/runtime sources and every mandatory runtime group against a separately reviewed owner-pinned provenance trust policy; no caller-selected service URLs, commands, sources or success flags.",
    "GitHub artifact_sha256 hashes binary ZIP bytes. Separately enforce compressed archive, total expanded bytes, per-member bytes and member count before and during extraction; reject links/encryption/unsafe or duplicate paths/unsupported members/CRC failures. Measurement manifests alone use UTF8/canonical JSON bounds. Closed measurement schemas and reviewed workflow/provenance/evidence retrieval are a separate unimplemented contract; these limits do not make ZIPs or measurement claims admissible.",
    "Verify artifact bytes/digests, closed runtime measurement manifests and all required measured outcomes. Missing/faked/manual/static-only/wrong-source evidence fails closed. Pass text or caller report hash alone is never admissible.",
    "Until evidence retrieval, provenance policy and current-access propagation veto are implemented and tested, runtime admission remains closed. These schemas expose no ability.",
    "Recheck current original requester/Directory/principal/role/current authority/source/epoch/expiry and original target revision before and under authoritative storage transaction. Retain one complete encrypted report immutably and audit attributable outcome.",
    "No Child mutation, publication, user approval, backup replacement, consumer binding or production activation. One report per job; lost response requires exact authoritative reconciliation, never overwrite."
  ]
